   "body": "<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe focused refactor preserves existing timing behavior while reducing redundant DOM queries.\n\n**0 open findings**\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nOptimizes chat-input discovery polling in the Playwright launch helper.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Caches locator candidate counts per polling attempt.\n- Adds a configurable polling interval.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `.agents/​skills/​launch/​playwrightScripts/​focus-chat-input.ts` | Optimizes candidate iteration and parameterizes polling delay. |\n</details>\n\n🧠 **Review effort:** Balanced\n\n---\n\n💡 Configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>",
